reak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、途中からは我慢しないで\nちっぷと一緒に庭を駆け回りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足が埋まっちゃってうまく歩けない\nちっぷがとってもかわいかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとSな私でも、冷たそうだったからすぐに救出に向かいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅんことらぶらぶ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表の収録から少し時間経ってると思うけど、選抜メンバーになって１期生と一緒になることが増えた今の状況に少しは慣れた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→まだ緊張します！:(´◦ω◦｀):\n先輩方は優しくて気にかけて下さり、話しかけてくれるんですが、まだ緊張しちゃって上手く話せません(´ﾟдﾟ｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログは覗くだけでいいのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→覗いてもらえるだけでも嬉しいですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で覚えられるようにするにはどうすれば良いかな...??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→何か特徴があれば覚えやすいです！服装とか小物とかアクセサリーとかなんでも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問したいんだけど、特技ガオーって何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→がおーは手の形をひっかくような形にすること！がおーってゆって威嚇したり噛み付いたりしても大丈夫！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなかんじ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影:れなち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2期生の中の推しって誰？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→うーん、誰だろう。まいちゅんとみりあとかかな(*˘︶˘*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は高校一年生です！年下の女の子のファンは嬉しいですか？( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→とっても嬉しいです♡年上でも年下でも女の子でも男の子でも女の人でも男の人でも犬でも猫でも虎でもパンダでもコアラでも誰でも嬉しい(´･ω･`) 人(´･ω･`)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はまだ中2だけど\nきいちゃんって呼んでいい!!??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→全然いいよー！嬉しい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"h